    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "It is the night of the Cesars, and Camille is getting dressed for the invitation Mathias gave her. Her mother is helping by video call from the south of France, watching through Camille's laptop. She is proud, fussy and still worried about Mathias. Listen to the French conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Il t'invite à des soirées?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Les Césars, Maman. Une exception.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Donc tout le bureau est au courant?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Non, personne ne sait. C'est purement professionnel.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Tourne-toi. Il vient te chercher?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Non, je prends le métro.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Classe! Serre un peu ta ceinture.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Je n'arrive pas à respirer.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Non, laisse, ça te fait une belle silhouette.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Laisse-moi te regarder.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Trop vulgaire?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Vulgaire? Une femme Valentini n'est jamais vulgaire!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Les filles à Paris sont plus sobres.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Elles mangent des graines et font la tête, c'est tout!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "D'accord. Bisous, Maman!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Prends des photos des stars. Et Camille, n'attends rien de lui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Et ne bois pas trop!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "maman",
      "t": "Si tu vois Sophie Marceau, prends une photo!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go back to the video call. Camille's mother wants to know what the invitation really means.",
